  <section class="hero">
    <div class="eyebrow">AI trust, buy-in, and adoption capacity</div>
    <h1>The future belongs to curious organizations.</h1>
    <p class="hero-copy">Metaviews helps organizations turn AI pressure into practical curiosity, shared literacy, stakeholder buy-in, and trustworthy adoption.</p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a class="button" href="#contact" data-analytics-label="hero-start-conversation">Start a conversation</a>
